  Title: Most patients support AI to help read mammograms with doctor oversight: Newsroom - utsouthwestern.edu
  Source: Google News Radiology
  URL: https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPV21BRF81NlhPSVhZSmU2bnJqS2tqbXRmRVN3UzlaUTFuTS04aXh4bTl6cTZKRDNJekZHQ2ZCVjM1WFBVQjc2dmdNZmpaaXVrdEJUSVhqM3BURUdvNU90LTVGOUlvVG1ncTlhZUJPc1U1VF90YkxTbGNiZnpxaV93Tm5kU0F0VTJ0?oc=5
  Category: news
